# Online shop from the analysis of use case diagrams and the verifier test "perfect use case diagram" of the
# learning platform: roles with generalization, a system actor, include, extend with an extension point, and the
# generalization of a use case.
diagram usecase "Onlineshop" subtitle="Rollen, Systemakteur, include, extend und Generalisierung" locale=de
actor gast "Gast"
actor kunde "Kunde"
actor stamm "Stammkunde"
actor psp "Zahlungsdienst" kind=system
actor support "Support"
subject shop "Onlineshop"
usecase suchen "Produkte suchen" in shop
usecase bestellen "Bestellung aufgeben" in shop points="vor Abschluss"
usecase login "Anmelden" in shop
usecase bezahlen "Bezahlen" in shop
usecase gutschein "Gutschein einlösen" in shop
usecase storno "Bestellung stornieren" in shop
usecase express "Express bestellen" in shop
usecase pruefen "Bestellung prüfen" in shop
rel kunde -|> gast
rel stamm -|> kunde
rel gast -- suchen
rel kunde -- bestellen
rel kunde -- storno
rel stamm -- express
rel support -- pruefen
rel psp -- bezahlen source=1 card=0..*
rel bestellen --> login include
rel bestellen --> bezahlen include
rel gutschein --> bestellen extend when="Gutschein vorhanden" at="vor Abschluss"
rel express -|> bestellen
